'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\00 - Set Up Log Database
' Version    : 3.9.9  (BulkReg release; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents 3.9.9)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegAgents (BR_RunSetupLog).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: open the agent, click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this
'              WHOLE file, Ctrl+S. Designer puts each part in its place automatically.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (NOT 'All selected documents' - Designer's default - or Notes asks for a selected document)
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegAgents > BR_RunSetupLog):
'   Creates the form and the 8 categorized "BulkReg\..." views in the central
'   log database (LogServer!!LogDb). Run it once after creating the log database
'   and after releases that change the views. Needs Designer/Manager access to
'   the log database (normally the database owner). Changes no log documents.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegAgents"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunSetupLog()
End Sub
